@startuml Backend_Component_Diagram
package "Express & Next.js Backend System" {
    [Routes Layer] as Routes
    [Middleware Chain] as Middlewares
    [Controllers Layer] as Controllers
    [Services Layer] as Services
    [Repositories Layer] as Repositories
    [Prisma Client] as Prisma
}

database "PostgreSQL" as DB
database "Redis" as Cache

Routes --> Middlewares : Inbound HTTP Request
Middlewares --> Controllers : Validated Context (req.user, req.organization)
Controllers --> Services : Invoke Business Logic
Services --> Repositories : Query Data
Repositories --> Prisma : Execute Database Calls
Prisma --> DB : SQL Statements
Services --> Cache : Read Session / Cache Data
@enduml
